[{"text":"InverseMellin[exp, y] performs the inverse Mellin transform of polynomials in OPE. The inverse transforms are not calculated but a table-lookup is done.","anchor":"inversemellin"},{"text":"WARNING: do not “trust” the results for the inverse Mellin transform involving SumT’s; there is an unresolved inconsistency here (related to \\((-1)^{m}\\)).","anchor":"inversemellin"},{"text":"Overview, DeltaFunction, Integrate2, OPEm, SumS, SumT.","anchor":"see-also","section":"See also"},{"text":"InverseMellin[1/OPEm, y]","anchor":"cb1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[y^{m-1}\\]","anchor":"cb1-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"InverseMellin[1/(OPEm + 3), y]","anchor":"cb2","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[y^{m+2}\\]","anchor":"cb2-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"InverseMellin[1, y]","anchor":"cb3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[y^{m-1} \\delta (1-y)\\]","anchor":"cb3-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"InverseMellin[1/OPEm^4, y]","anchor":"cb4","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[-\\frac{1}{6} y^{m-1} \\log ^3(y)\\]","anchor":"cb4-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"InverseMellin[1/OPEm + 1, y]","anchor":"cb5","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[y^{m-1} \\delta (1-y)+y^{m-1}\\]","anchor":"cb5-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"InverseMellin[1/i + 1, y, i]","anchor":"cb6","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[y^{i-1} \\delta (1-y)+y^{i-1}\\]","anchor":"cb6-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"The inverse operation to InverseMellin is done by Integrate2.","anchor":"cb6-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"Integrate2[InverseMellin[1/OPEm, y], {y, 0, 1}]","anchor":"cb7","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\frac{1}{m}\\]","anchor":"cb7-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"Below is a list of all built-in basic inverse Mellin transforms .","anchor":"cb7-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"list = {1, 1/(OPEm + n), 1/(-OPEm + n), PolyGamma[0, OPEm], SumS[1, -1 + OPEm], SumS[1, -1 + OPEm]/(OPEm - 1), SumS[1, -1 + OPEm]/(1 - OPEm), SumS[1, -1 + OPEm]/(OPEm + 1), SumS[1, -1 + OPEm]/OPEm^2, SumS[1, -1 + OPEm]/OPEm, SumS[1, -1 + OPEm]^2/OPEm, SumS[2, -1 + OPEm], SumS[2, -1 + OPEm]/OPEm, SumS[3, -1 + OPEm], SumS[1, 1, -1 + OPEm], SumS[1, OPEm - 1]^2, SumS[1, 2, -1 + OPEm], SumS[2, 1, -1 + OPEm],SumS[1, -1 + OPEm]^3, SumS[1, -1 + OPEm] SumS[2, -1 + OPEm], SumS[1, 1, 1, -1 + OPEm]};","anchor":"cb8","section":"Examples"},{"text":"im[z_] := z -> InverseMellin[z, y]","anchor":"cb9","section":"Examples"},{"text":"im[OPEm^(-3)]","anchor":"cb10","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\frac{1}{m^3}\\to \\frac{1}{2} y^{m-1} \\log ^2(y)\\]","anchor":"cb10-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"im[OPEm^(-2)]","anchor":"cb11","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\frac{1}{m^2}\\to -y^{m-1} \\log (y)\\]","anchor":"cb11-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"im[PolyGamma[0, OPEm]]","anchor":"cb12","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\psi ^{(0)}(m)\\to -\\gamma y^{m-1} \\delta (1-y)-\\left(\\frac{1}{1-y}\\right)_+ y^{m-1}\\]","anchor":"cb12-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"im[SumS[1, OPEm - 1]]","anchor":"cb13","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[S_1(m-1)\\to \\left(\\frac{1}{1-y}\\right)_+ \\left(-y^{m-1}\\right)\\]","anchor":"cb13-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"im[SumS[1, OPEm - 1]/(OPEm - 1)]","anchor":"cb14","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\frac{S_1(m-1)}{m-1}\\to -y^{m-2} \\log (1-y)\\]","anchor":"cb14-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"im[SumS[1, OPEm - 1]/(OPEm + 1)]","anchor":"cb15","section":"Examples"}]